section:: 1. Formatting Text


subsection:: 1.1. Text


subsection:: :sub:1.1.1. Quotation marks, quotation dash, ellipsis marks and apostrophe


The following quotation marks can be used to make SuperCollider help documents more reader-friendly and improve readability:

list::

##SINGLE QUOTATION

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_ql'_
::
||
_ql'_
##
code::
_qr'_
::
||
_qr'_
::

## DOUBLE QUOTATION

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_ql"_
::
||
_ql"_
##
code::
_qr"_
::
||
_qr"_
::

## QUOTATIOM DASH _m(_dashHORIZONTAL BAR_m)_

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_q-_
::
||
_q-_
::

## MIDLINE HORIZONTAL ELLIPSIS

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_me..._
::
||
_me..._
::

## HORIZONTAL ELLIPSIS

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_ue..._
::
||
_ue..._
::

## MODIFIER LETTER APOSTROPHE

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_a''_
::
||
_a''_
::
::


table::
##strong::Examples::
table::
##
list::
## Andreas asked me: _ql"_Have you read the _ql'_EU Expansion_qr'_ article?_qr"_
## _e..._ Jack_a''_s and Jill_a''_s children
## _e..._ 잭과 질의 아이들
::
_m(__q-_ From Wikipedia article "Quotation mark
"_m)_
::
::



subsection:: :sub:1.1.2. Alternative quotation marks


The following quotation marks can be used to make SuperCollider help documents more reader-friendly and improve readability:


list::

## LOW-9 QUOTATION MARK

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_ll"_
::
||
_ll"_
##
code::
_lr"_
::
||
_lr"_
::


DOUBLE LOW-9 QUOTATION MARK

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_ll'_
::
||
_ll'_
##
code::
_lr'_
::
||
_lr'_
::

## POINTING ANGLE

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_p<_
::
||
_p<_
##
code::
_p>_
::
||
_p>_
::

## POINTING DOUBLE ANGLE

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_p<<_
::
||
_p<<_
##
code::
_p>>_
::
||
_p>>_
::

## MATHEMATICAL ANGLE BRACKET

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_m<_
::
||
_m<_
##
code::
_m>_
::
||
_m>_
::

## MATHEMATICAL DOUBLE ANGLE BRACKET

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_m<<_
::
||
_m<<_
##
code::
_m>>_
::
||
_m>>_
::

## ANGLE BRACKET

emphasis::If these symbols are problematic with some font due to spacing, use mathematical double angle.::

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_n<_
::
||
_n<_
##
code::
_n>_
::
||
_n>_
::

## DOUBLE ANGLE BRACKET

emphasis::If these symbols are problematic with some font due to spacing, use mathematical angle.::

table::
## code to show || result
