table::
##strong::Examples::
table::
##
list::
## « Voulez-vous un sandwich, Henri ? »
## Andreas fragte mich: _ll"_Hast du den Artikel _ll'_EU-Erweiterung_lr'_ gelesen?_lr"_
## Andreas fragte mich: _p>>_Hast du den Artikel _p>_EU-Erweiterung_p<_ gelesen?_p<<_
## This is _m<<_The SuperCollider Book_m>>_.
## This is _m<_The SuperCollider Book_m>_.
## This is _n<<_The SuperCollider Book_n>>_.
## This is _n<_The SuperCollider Book_n>_.
## This is _c<_The SuperCollider Book_c>_.
## This is _w<_The SuperCollider Book_w>_.
::
_m(__q-_ From Wikipedia article "Quotation mark
"_m)_
::
::






subsection:: :sub:1.1.3. Alternative brackets for predefined small size text


The following brackets make themselves and the text within smaller and are useful when the text is written in non-Roman alphabets:
list::
## ❪❫: MEDIUM FLATTENED LEFT PARENTHESIS ORNAMENT.

0.85em. It can be used for year for example.

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_f(__f)_
::
||
_f(__f)_
::

## ❨❩: MEDIUM LEFT PARENTHESIS ORNAMENT

0.85em. It can be used for explanatory text for example.

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_m(__m)_
::
||
_m(__m)_
::

## ❲❳: LIGHT TORTOISE SHELL BRACKET ORNAMENT

0.71em. It can be used for the origin of the word.

table::
## code to show || result
##
code::
_s(__s)_
::
||
_s(__s)_
::
::



table::
## strong::Examples::
list::
## akousmatikós _s(_lἀκουσματικός_s)_
## reduced listening _s(_l'écoute
réduite_s)_
## Pierre Schaeffer 'Études de bruits' _f(_1948_f)_.
## SuperCollider _m(_a cross-platform environment for audio synthesis and algorithmic composition used by musicians, artists and researchers working with sound_m)_ can be installed and run on Linux, macOS and Windows, as well as microcomputers such as Raspberry Pi and BeagleBone Black.
::
::





