<th style='border:2px solid #ccc; width:30%'>result</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan='2' class='merged-cell'>inlined</td>
<td>
LaTeX
</td>
<td>
code::
This is a \(\pi\) symbol in LaTeX.
::
</td>
<td>
This is a \(\pi\) symbol in LaTeX.
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
MathML
</td>
<td>
code::
This is a <math><mi>&#x3C0;</mi></math> symbol in MathML.
::
</td>
<td>
This is a <math><mi>&#x3C0;</mi></math> symbol in MathML.
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
