Therefore, the ratio of teletype::two octaves lower frequency : one octave lower frequency : a given frequency : one octave higher frequency : two octaves higher frequency:: is teletype::1/4 : 1/2 : 1 : 2 : 4::.
It is expressed using the exponent as teletype::2 ** -2  :  2 ** -1  : 2 ** 0  : 2 ** 1  :  2 ** 2:: or teletype::2.pow(-2) : 2.pow(-1) : 2.pow(0) : 2.pow(1) : 2.pow(2)::.
