Therefore, the ratio of teletype::two octaves lower frequency : one octave lower frequency : a given frequency : one octave higher frequency : two octaves higher frequency:: is \(\frac{1}{4}:\frac{1}{2}:1:2:4\).
It is expressed using the exponent as \(2^{-2}:2^{-1}:2^0:2^1:2^2\).
::


