subsection:: :sub:1.2.5. Equations



The following code represents a mathematical equation using LaTeX Synthex via link::https://www.mathjax.org/#gettingstarted#MathJax script::. The script is automatically included by SC when it renders the SC-Doc to HTML, so you don't need to include it again. This cannot be inlined.

code::
\[x = {-b \pm \sqrt{b^2-4ac} \over 2a}.\]
::
\[x = {-b \pm \sqrt{b^2-4ac} \over 2a}.\]

