subsection:: 1.3. Embedding other HTML with iframe


The following code embeds a web page in an html document:

code::
<iframe width='100%' height='500' src='https://supercollider.github.io/' title='SuperCollider Forum scsynth' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe>
::
<iframe width='100%' height='500' src='https://supercollider.github.io/' title='SuperCollider Forum scsynth' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe>





section:: 2. Multimedia


subsection:: 2.1. Audio


subsection:: :sub:2.1.1. Offline Audio


The following code demonstrates audio control using one or more local audio files:

code::
<audio controls>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.mp3' type='audio/mpeg'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.ogg' type='audio/ogg'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.wav' type='audio/wav'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.aiff' type='audio/aiff'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.flac' type='audio/flac'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.m4a' type='audio/mp4'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.wma' type='audio/x-ms-wma'>
Your browser does not support the audio element.
</audio>
::

<audio controls>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.mp3' type='audio/mpeg'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.ogg' type='audio/ogg'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.wav' type='audio/wav'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.aiff' type='audio/aiff'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.flac' type='audio/flac'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.m4a' type='audio/mp4'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/a11wlk01.wma' type='audio/x-ms-wma'>
Your browser does not support the audio element.
</audio>





subsection:: :sub:2.1.2. Online Audio


The following code demonstrates audio control with an online audio file:

code::
<audio controls>
<source src='https://www.w3schools.com/html/horse.ogg' type='audio/ogg'>
Your browser does not support the audio element.
</audio>
::

<audio controls>
<source src='https://www.w3schools.com/html/horse.ogg' type='audio/ogg'>
Your browser does not support the audio element.
</audio>










subsection:: 2.2. Video


subsection:: :sub:2.2.1. Offline Video

The following code demonstrates video control using a local video file:

table::
##size <br><br> not <br><br> defined
||
code::
<video controls>
<source src='../Reference/resources/wave_propagation_simulation_2D.mp4' title='2D simulation of the propagation of a wave in air' type='video/mp4'>
</video>
::
<video controls>
<source src='../Reference/resources/wave_propagation_simulation_2D.mp4' title='2D simulation of the propagation of a wave in air' type='video/mp4'>
</video>
##size <br><br> defined
||
code::
<video controls width='618' height='330'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/wave_propagation_simulation_2D.mp4' title='2D simulation of the propagation of a wave in air' type='video/mp4'>
</video>
::
<video controls width='618' height='330'>
<source src='../Reference/resources/wave_propagation_simulation_2D.mp4' title='2D simulation of the propagation of a wave in air' type='video/mp4'>
</video>
